<Page title="Privacy Policy" heading="Privacy Policy" intro="How DigiAds.click handles information shared through this website."><p>We use the details you submit only to respond to your enquiry and to provide the services you ask for. We do not sell personal information.</p>
<h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
<p>This website uses Google Analytics 4 to count visits and see which pages and audits are used. It is switched off until you choose “Accept analytics” in the banner. If you choose “No thanks”, or your browser sends a Global Privacy Control signal, no analytics script is loaded and nothing is sent to Google. We do not use advertising cookies, remarketing or ad personalisation.</p>
<p>If you accept, Google sets cookies named <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code> for up to two years and receives your IP address, device and page-view information. Your choice is saved only in your browser and is asked again after six months or when this wording changes. You can change it at any time with “Cookie settings” in the footer, and declining removes the cookies.</p>
<p>The checkout and enquiry forms do not use analytics cookies. Payments are processed by Razorpay, which applies its own privacy policy.</p>
<h2>Your information</h2>
<p>Contact us to request access, correction or deletion of information you have shared.</p></Page>
